ew_i18n/kr","소니아, 치피가 폐허에서 이걸 찾았어요! 블러디 로즈의 마크인 것 같아요!"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411270.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411270.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 索尼娅"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/kr","치피 & 소니아"],["/interaction_records/5/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","黑棘海"],["/interaction_records/5/locations/0/name_i18n/kr","블랙본 해역"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","你们知道，之前的绿水村是什么样的吗？"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/kr","이전의 그린브룩 마을이 어떤 모습이었는지 알아?"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411310.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411310.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","索尼娅 & 漫漫 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/kr","소니아 & 해미 & 치피"],["/interaction_records/6/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","黑棘海"],["/interaction_records/6/locations/0/name_i18n/kr","블랙본 해역"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","死潮舰队……呵，他们抓了不少我的兄弟姐妹。"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/kr","죽음의 함대... 하, 놈들이 우리 형제자매들을 많이 잡아갔지."],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411320.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411320.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","索尼娅"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/kr","소니아"],["/interaction_records/7/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","黑棘海"],["/interaction_records/7/locations/0/name_i18n/kr","블랙본 해역"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","死潮舰队留下的实验记录，真是越看越让人心惊……"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/kr","죽음의 함대가 남긴 실험 기록은 보면 볼수록 놀라울 정도네요..."],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411350.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/kr","locales/kr/ep2/herohub_story/12411350.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 索尼娅"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/kr","해미 & 소니아"],["/interaction_records/8/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","黑棘海"],["/interactio